      "date": "2026-10-17 10:38:42.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\n(8 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments. Two new rules (fail_loc/fail_val order, and lustre_compat include paths) don't match the current tree and would lead agents to write racy tests or code that does not pick up the compat helpers. Those are worth a refresh; the rest are optional nits to fix at the same time.",
